# Registers the fail-fast active-profile guard so it runs at
# ApplicationEnvironmentPreparedEvent for BOTH CoreApplication.main() and every
# @SpringBootTest boot. This auto-discovery is what makes the {dev,test} and
# {prod,test} context tests exercise the validator as a built-in regression net.
# See Issue #78 [P0-2].
org.springframework.boot.env.EnvironmentPostProcessor=uk.jtoye.core.config.ActiveProfileValidator
